# Ownership for the surfaces that machines act on without a human in the loop.
#
# The acquisition descriptors in cli_manifests/*/RULES.json tell CI which binaries to download and
# execute on a runner, and which commands promotion runs. A manifest-only PR is therefore a
# code-execution surface, not a data surface, and must not be mergeable on a docs-shaped review.
/cli_manifests/*/RULES.json      @spenquatch
/crates/xtask/data/agent_registry.toml  @spenquatch

# The reusable lanes those descriptors drive.
/.github/workflows/parity-acquire.yml   @spenquatch
/.github/workflows/parity-promote.yml   @spenquatch
/.github/workflows/agent-maintenance-open-pr.yml     @spenquatch
/.github/workflows/agent-maintenance-release-watch.yml @spenquatch
